About Chivalry:
Whats good ?
-The different moves you can execute;
-The gore;
-4 different classes;
-Lots of different weapons;
-Nice gamemodes.
What's bad ?
- Players always mad ( some players dont like to die so they will anoy us in the chat);
- Internet Connetion ( some people have internet connetion problems);
- Items bought with real currency ( nothing pay to win );
- Team Killing.
Chivalry it's an awsome game with good graphics, funnier with friends. But the people who buy the game, can ruin it depending on your atitude.
8.5 / 10, buy it !

First of all I am very happy with this game! I think it is a great improvement of Endless Space 1.
Pros:
Better tech tree;
Better Graphics;
More political involement;
Lots of new contents;
and it feels fresh!
Still I found some bugs:
Sometimes ending a turn keeps loading for ever... Dw I have autosave on, but its frustrating.
Ships I build (as template) in shipbuilding, dissappear. or get replaced. For example I build a carrier ship called the Enterprice, after that I updated my hero's flagship. I came back to the shipyard and my carrier was replaced by the hero (small) ship. Leaving all my carriers unupgradable.
I hope you guys can solve this!
THANK, it is a great game :-)

